{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42274","headline":"送陈先生之洪井寄萧少卿 · 徐铉","name":"送陈先生之洪井寄萧少卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君仙袂指洪厓，我忆情人别路赊。\n知有欢娱游楚泽，更无书札到京华。\n云开驿阁连江静，春满西山倚汉斜。\n此处相逢应见问，爲言搔首望龙沙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}